parents weren't religious,

00:01:38.706 --> 00:01:46.035
but they had a very reverential
attitude towards The New York Times.

00:01:46.035 --> 00:01:51.770
And if some big story was
published in The New York Times,

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:54.530
that was the truth to them.

00:01:54.530 --> 00:02:02.095
And, I grew up inculcated with
that same kind of admiration and

00:02:02.095 --> 00:02:08.205
belief in the accuracy and
integrity of the information that was in

00:02:08.205 --> 00:02:12.595
that newspaper, which back then,
of course, was just the print newspaper.

00:02:13.855 --> 00:02:17.465
To give you an idea, I grew up on
the upper west side of Manhattan,

00:02:17.465 --> 00:02:21.085
how devoted Times readers my parents were.

00:02:22.525 --> 00:02:26.900
We actually had two home
delivery subscriptions

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:32.950
because my father liked to
